# Changeworks CODEOWNERS (DESIGN §2.3 "GitHub enforcement", §2.4).
# Install as .github/CODEOWNERS and replace mdanialqureshi with your
# GitHub login. It lists only the protected paths, so the ruleset's
# "require review from Code Owners" blocks factory merges that touch
# them and nothing else. Keep it in step with
# changeworks.contract.PROTECTED_PATHS.

# Workflows, issue forms, this file and the Claude settings file
.github/                @mdanialqureshi

# Claude Code configuration the agent must never change
.claude/                @mdanialqureshi
.mcp.json               @mdanialqureshi
CLAUDE.md               @mdanialqureshi
CLAUDE.local.md         @mdanialqureshi

# The factory's policy for this repo, and ownership itself
factory.toml            @mdanialqureshi
CODEOWNERS              @mdanialqureshi

# Lockfiles
*.lock                  @mdanialqureshi
package-lock.json       @mdanialqureshi
npm-shrinkwrap.json     @mdanialqureshi
pnpm-lock.yaml          @mdanialqureshi
bun.lockb               @mdanialqureshi
go.sum                  @mdanialqureshi

# Infrastructure
/infra/                 @mdanialqureshi
/cdk.json               @mdanialqureshi
